data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-p6-form2","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_005abdac8001uZ3USN0QZ3EEeS","role":"user","content":"用 render_a2ui 渲染一个销售筛选表单（surfaceId=p6-form2）：TextField 品类关键词（value 绑定 data.keyword，带两条校验：required 提示\"关键词必填\"、regex ^.{2,}$ 提示\"至少 2 个字符\"）、一个 Button 提交（primary，带 required 校验关联 keyword，action event=apply_filter）。data 模型 keyword 初始为空字符串。不要漏掉根容器。"},{"id":"msg_005abdd21001Zpb97U597ttUeb-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render an A2UI form. Let me follow the instructions carefully.\n\nRequirements:\n- surfaceId=p6-form2\n- TextField 品类关键词 (value bound to data.keyword, with two validations: required with \"关键词必填\", regex ^.{2,}$ with \"至少 2 个字符\")\n- A Button submit (primary, with required validation linked to keyword, action event=apply_filter)\n- data model keyword initial empty string\n- Don't forget the root container\n\nLet me build the components. The root must have id \"root\". The root container should be a Column (since we have multiple children: TextField and Button).\n\nFor the TextField: \n- component: TextField\n- label: 品类关键词\n- value: {path: keyword}\n- checks: [{call: \"required\", args: {value: {path: \"keyword\"}}, message: \"关键词必填\"}, {call: \"regex\", args: {value: {path: \"keyword\"}, pattern: \"^.{2,}$\"}, message: \"至少 2 个字符\"}]\n\nWait, how does the regex check work? The spec says checks:[{call:\"required\",args:{value:{path:\"keyword\"}},message:\"关键词必填\"}]. For regex, likely args include pattern. Let me use args: {value: {path: \"keyword\"}, pattern: \"^.{2,}$\"}.\n\nFor the Button:\n- component: Button\n- child: a Text component with text \"提交\"\n- variant: primary\n- checks: [{call:\"required\",args:{value:{path:\"keyword\"}},message:\"关键词必填\"}] — the instruction says \"带 required 校验关联 keyword\"\n- action: {event: {name: \"apply_filter\"}}\n\nRoot container: Column with children referencing the TextField id and the Button id (or its child Text). Let me structure:\n\ncomponents:\n1. Column id=root, children: [\"keyword-field\", \"submit-button\"]\n2. TextField id=keyword-field, label 品类关键词, value {path: keyword}, checks...\n3. Button id=submit-button, child: Text id=submit-label text=提交, variant primary, checks..., action {event: {name: apply_filter}}\n4. Text id=submit-label text=提交\n\ndata: {keyword: \"\"}\n\nLet me render it."},{"id":"msg_005abdd21001Zpb97U597ttUeb","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_eDWHdrgOeYQJGx9bF2Ls2066","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"p6-form2\",\"data\":{\"keyword\":\"\"},\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"keyword-field\",\"submit-button\"]},{\"component\":\"TextField\",\"id\":\"keyword-field\",\"label\":\"品类关键词\",\"value\":{\"path\":\"keyword\"},\"checks\":[{\"call\":\"required\",\"args\":{\"value\":{\"path\":\"keyword\"}},\"message\":\"关键词必填\"},{\"call\":\"regex\",\"args\":{\"value\":{\"path\":\"keyword\"},\"pattern\":\"^.{2,}$\"},\"message\":\"至少 2 个字符\"}]},{\"component\":\"Button\",\"id\":\"submit-button\",\"child\":\"submit-label\",\"variant\":\"primary\",\"checks\":[{\"call\":\"required\",\"args\":{\"value\":{\"path\":\"keyword\"}},\"message\":\"关键词必填\"}],\"action\":{\"event\":{\"name\":\"apply_filter\"}}},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"submit-label\",\"text\":\"提交\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_eDWHdrgOeYQJGx9bF2Ls2066","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_eDWHdrgOeYQJGx9bF2Ls2066","content":"UI surface \"p6-form2\" rendered (4 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_005ac0672001suJMA87Pd1IZ5f","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 `p6-form2`：关键词输入框（必填 + 至少 2 字符校验）、primary 提交按钮（绑定 `apply_filter` 事件，同样关联 keyword 必填），根容器为 Column。"}]}

